### 1. 创建课程
POST http://localhost:8082/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 9039559a-1f5d-4f16-a438-d3f223e3ac49
X-User-Id: S003

{
  "teacherId": 1,
  "name": "计算机科学导论",
  "code": "CS99",
  "outline": "计算机科学基础课程",
  "objective": "了解计算机科学的基本概念",
  "assessment": "期末考试 + 平时作业"
}

### 2. 获取用户课程列表
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/user/10
Authorization: Bearer bba8033e-3a83-44e7-b5cc-3aa67afdbbf6
X-User-Id: S003

### 3. 获取课程详情
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer bba8033e-3a83-44e7-b5cc-3aa67afdbbf6
X-User-Id: S003

### 4. 更新课程
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/courses/9
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 9039559a-1f5d-4f16-a438-d3f223e3ac49
X-User-Id: S003

{
  "teacherId": 1,
  "name": "计算机科学导论（更新版）",
  "code": "CS99",
  "outline": "计算机科学基础课程 - 更新版",
  "objective": "了解计算机科学的基本概念和最新发展",
  "assessment": "期末考试 + 平时作业 + 项目实践"
}

### 5. 删除课程
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/courses/9
Authorization: Bearer 9039559a-1f5d-4f16-a438-d3f223e3ac49
X-User-Id: S003

### 6. 获取所有课程
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/list
Authorization: Bearer bba8033e-3a83-44e7-b5cc-3aa67afdbbf6
X-User-Id: S003

